WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.502
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.636
We hope you're doing well
tonight,

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:05.104
and now we're going
to get to the news.

00:00:05.104 --> 00:00:07.874
The annual New York City
St. Patrick's Day parade

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:10.610
was held today after being
canceled for two years

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.378
because of the coronavirus
pandemic.

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:15.148
Of course, they've had
to update the buttons.

00:00:15.148 --> 00:00:16.983
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:20.987
President Biden is set
to speak tomorrow

00:00:20.987 --> 00:00:23.689
with Chinese President
Xi Jinping, and Biden is all set

00:00:23.689 --> 00:00:26.192
to remind China
why they need us.

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:29.696
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:32.932
Netflix announced yesterday
that the political satire show

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:35.167
"Servant of the People"
that stars

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:37.437
Ukrainian President
Volodymyr Zelenskyy

00:00:37.437 --> 00:00:39.138
will return to the platform.

00:00:39.138 --> 00:00:42.675
And they're also taking down
Putin's standup special.

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:44.510
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:46.379
[ Russian accent ] Yeah, so just
broke up with girlfriend.

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:48.814
Feel bad.

00:00:48.814 --> 00:00:51.184
So I bought her a trip
to Siberia.

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:55.188
This guy knows
what I'm talking about.

00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:56.823
[ Normal voice ] President Biden
announced yesterday

00:00:56.823 --> 00:01:00.192
that the U.S. will provide a new
assistance package for Ukraine,

00:01:00.192 --> 00:01:03.263
which includes 800
anti-aircraft systems.

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:06.566
We're giving them the best
anti-aircraft system we have --

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:08.067
drunk passengers.

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:10.837
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.837 --> 00:01:13.840
[ Slurring ]
I'm not wearing a mask.

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:16.042
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.042 --> 00:01:20.180
[ Normal voice ] A cargo ship
named "Ever Forward" is stuck

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.981
in Maryland's Chesapeake Bay
after running

00:01:22.981 --> 00:01:24.383
aground on a sandbar.

00:01:24.383 --> 00:01:26.752
And they're really rolling
the dice by sending

00:01:26.752 --> 00:01:28.688
the "Never Sinks" to save it.

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:31.357
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.292 --> 00:01:34.760
In a new interview
with Bloomberg,

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:37.763
a sanctioned Russian billionaire
said that he now has to live on

00:01:37.763 --> 00:01:40.633
$3,300 per month.
That's weird.

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:43.002
They're making him
teach high school?

00:01:43.002 --> 00:01:45.604
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.604 --> 00:01:47.540
[ Audience groans ]

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.309
Alright. [ Mutters ]

00:01:52.011 --> 00:01:55.815
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.815 --> 00:01:57.850
Officials in Spain
recently impounded

00:01:57.850 --> 00:01:59.786
a third superyacht
that's believed

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:02.622
to belong to a Russian oligarch,
mostly because they're not

00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:04.691
very creative
with their boat names.

00:02:04.691 --> 00:02:07.860
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:10.896
Republican Pennsylvania
Senate hopeful Dr. Mehmet Oz

00:02:10.896 --> 00:02:12.732
said yesterday that he would
renounce his

00:02:12.732 --> 00:02:15.367
dual Turkish citizenship
if he gets election --

00:02:15.367 --> 00:02:16.402
elected, excuse me.

00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:18.471
No word yet on when
he'll renounce

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:19.939
the title of doctor.

00:02:19.939 --> 00:02:22.040
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:24.944
Transportation officials
in New York yesterday announced

00:02:24.944 --> 00:02:27.380
plans to raise the flat fee
for a taxi

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:30.383
between J.F.K. Airport
in Manhattan to $65.

00:02:30.383 --> 00:02:31.617
That's crazy!

00:02:31.617 --> 00:02:34.621
That's almost $15 an hour.

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:36.923
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.224 --> 00:02:42.128
We mathed them.

00:02:42.128 --> 00:02:44.230
We fully mathed them.
That's on us.

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:46.833
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:51.070
We didn't even give them pens
and paper or anything.

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:53.539
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.539 --> 00:02:56.876
And finally, tomorrow is
National Awkward Moments Day.

00:02:56.876 --> 00:02:59.279
This news first reported
by the guy who was

00:02:59.279 --> 00:03:01.748
actually waving to the person
behind you.

00:03:01.748 --> 00:03:04.250
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:09.556
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

